            <pb edRef="inst:4423" n="1b"/><lb edRef="inst:4423" n="1b1"/> || <rs type="deity">byang chub sems dpa' sems pa chen po gsung gi mnga' bdag 'jam dpal ye shes sems pa</rs> la phyag 'tshal lo ||</seg>
